                        "entry_id": "d8653440-ba0c-332f-ac8c-6c1abf417a68",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A street and a district of New York City, whose residents were traditionally of a low socioeconomic class."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5faf5f97-7e57-4ab7-b31b-5424951dba15",
                                "sense_id": "eb1ae4f3-a300-306d-986f-8a26ffecf420",
                                "text": "We were seen quarrelling this afternoon in a saloon over on the Bowery."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bbf1bec0-8298-4e0d-beeb-c2e59f61f627",
                                "sense_id": "eb1ae4f3-a300-306d-986f-8a26ffecf420",
                                "text": "[…] sewer people, derelicts, bag ladies, undergrounders, and Bowery bums. Whatever the cause of their illness, as in Scanners, homeless people are victims but, more importantly, a threat to be eliminated."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
